{"sha": "9275b09fd68fcfd4e961f0bb0d1fc1703fb3ff16ec66edf8b395fca05eb25ee2", "body": ["\\chapter{Square Roots}\\label{ch:g9:sqrt}", "", "边长为 $1$ 的正方形的对角线有多长？毕达哥拉斯定理", "给出 $\\sqrt 2$，它是平方为 $2$ 的数，", "而它并不是分数。本章定义平方根，建立", "平方根的运算法则，并讲解如何化简", "形如 $\\sqrt{75}$ 的式子。", "", "\\section{定义与基本性质}", "", "\\begin{definition}[平方根]\\label{def:g9:sqrt:def}", "设 $a \\geq 0$。$a$ 的\\emph{平方根}\\index{平方根}记作", "$\\sqrt a$，它是平方为 $a$ 的唯一\\emph{非负}数：", "\\[", "\\sqrt a \\geq 0", "\\qquad\\text{且}\\qquad", "\\left(\\sqrt a\\right)^2 = a .", "\\]", "负数没有平方根，因为任一数的平方都非负。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}", "$\\sqrt{49} = 7$, $\\sqrt 0 = 0$, $\\sqrt 1 = 1$,", "$\\sqrt{2.25} = 1.5$。需要熟记的第一批平方根是", "\\emph{完全平方数}的平方根：$1, 4, 9, 16, 25, 36, 49, 64, 81, 100, 121,", "144$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.35]", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omDef!8] (0,0) rectangle (2,2);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (0,0) -- (2,2);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1,0) {$1$};", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,1) {$1$};", "  \\node[omThm, above left=-2pt, font=\\small, rotate=45] at (1.08,0.92)", "    {$\\sqrt2$};", "  \\draw[thin] (1.75,0) -- (1.75,0.25) -- (2,0.25);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 单位正方形的对角线长为 $\\sqrt{1^2 + 1^2} =", "\\sqrt2 \\approx 1.414$，由毕达哥拉斯定理", "（\\cref{ch:g9:trig}中已回顾此定理）。这个数是无理数：它的小数", "永不循环。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[平方数的平方根]\\label{prop:g9:sqrt:square}", "对任一实数 $x$（不论正负）：", "\\[", "\\sqrt{x^2} = \\abs{x} =", "\\begin{cases}", "x & \\text{若 } x \\geq 0,\\\\", "-x & \\text{若 } x < 0 .", "\\end{cases}", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\abs{x}$ 非负，且其平方为 $x^2$（一个数与其相反数的", "平方相等）。由于它是平方为", "$x^2$ 的唯一非负数，故它即为 $\\sqrt{x^2}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}", "$\\sqrt{(-5)^2} = \\sqrt{25} = 5 = \\abs{-5}$：平方根“忘记”了符号，", "它并不会恢复符号。特别地，$\\sqrt{x^2} = x$ 对", "负数 $x$ 是\\emph{错误}的。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{平方根的乘积与商}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[乘法与除法法则]\\label{thm:g9:sqrt:rules}", "对所有 $a \\geq 0$ 与 $b \\geq 0$：", "\\[", "\\sqrt{a b} = \\sqrt a \\times \\sqrt b,", "\\qquad\\text{且对 } b > 0:\\quad", "\\sqrt{\\frac ab} = \\frac{\\sqrt a}{\\sqrt b} .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\sqrt a \\times \\sqrt b$ 非负（非负数之积），", "且其平方为", "\\[", "\\left(\\sqrt a \\times \\sqrt b\\right)^2", "= \\left(\\sqrt a\\right)^2 \\times \\left(\\sqrt b\\right)^2", "= a b .", "\\]", "由平方为 $ab$ 的非负数唯一，它等于", "$\\sqrt{ab}$。商的法则同理可证。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}[和的情形没有此法则！]", "一般地，$\\sqrt{a + b}$ \\emph{不}等于 $\\sqrt a + \\sqrt b$：", "\\[", "\\sqrt{9 + 16} = \\sqrt{25} = 5,", "\\qquad\\text{而}\\qquad", "\\sqrt 9 + \\sqrt{16} = 3 + 4 = 7 .", "\\]", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{method}[化简 $\\sqrt n$]\\label{met:g9:sqrt:simplify}", "要化简整数的平方根：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 求能整除 $n$ 的最大完全平方数（必要时", "        先分解 $n$）；", "  \\item 利用乘积法则拆分，并开出平方：", "        $\\sqrt{k^2 m} = k\\sqrt m$；", "  \\item 检验根号内剩下的", "        部分中不再含完全平方数因子。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", ""]}